      <activity id="a906a65c-3f0b-59cd-a2bf-b59db6335ce7" activityNameId="89e5ad83-f003-5b78-8ff4-8c8044bf6ba0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tram</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tram
Material consumption values refer to the production of one average tram (1 railcar and 0.55 trailer). Energy consumption is estimated from the energy content of the materials (50% energy of materials;
UUID: 81d51c67-8c29-375d-8674-e68a1de5d9b0
The inventory includes  processes of  material and energy consumption in vehicle manufacturing.  Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Material composition represents a tram produced in the early 90ties.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature studies. 
Extrapolations: Data from one production site in Switzerland is used as an first estimate for Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_81d51c67-8c29-375d-8674-e68a1de5d9b0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
